@startuml US_3_1_1_C4_Processos
title US 3.1.1 - Processo de arranque SPA

actor Dev as "Developer"
participant Browser
participant SPA as "Angular app"
participant API as "TodoApi"

Dev -> SPA: npm start / build
Browser -> SPA: Load assets
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me (startup check)
API --> SPA: 401 (se não logado) ou perfil
SPA -> Browser: render Layout + menu base
Browser -> SPA: navegar para feature
SPA -> API: REST call com credentials

@enduml
